    "title": "Meet the Republican candidates for Noblesville Township board - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jessica Todd ,\n11 hours ago Five Republican candidates are running for the Noblesville township board in the May 5 primary. The field includes challengers Thomas Houghtalen and Jo Spangler, and incumbents Joe Arrowood, Mary Sue Rowland and Peggy Pfister. Voters can select up to three candidates for the three-member board. The three GOP winners will... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
